      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto (second section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>P[ilatus the governor] (answered)</li>\n<li>[Yehoshu\u02bfa] and [said: &ldquo;The five disciples]</li>\n<li>of Yeshu were executed, and Yeshu</li>\n<li>the wicked and Yoh\u0323anan,</li>\n<li>who misled the people&mdash;what</li>\n<li>execution do they deserve?&rdquo;&nbsp; They answered</li>\n<li>and said to him: &ldquo;If</li>\n<li>our master [wi]shes, we shall send to [Tibe]rinus</li>\n<li>Caesar.&rdquo; And they sent and informed him.</li>\n<li>And when Tiberi[nus] Caesar heard,</li>\n<li>he said to them: &ldquo;B[ring them]</li>\n<li>to m[e!]&rdquo; And [ ... ... ]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
